{"id":"vorn","lemma":"vorn","pos":"adv","rank":1493,"glosses":["in front"],"ipa":"/fɔʁn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6f/De-vorn.ogg/De-vorn.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er machte einen Schritt nach vorn.","en":"He took a step forward.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755318","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"step, footstep"},{"g":"after / to"},null]},{"text":"Du kannst nicht von vorn anfangen.","en":"You can't start over.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"from / of"},null,{"g":"to begin"}]},{"text":"Ich sitze gerne vorn im Bus.","en":"I like to sit in the front of the bus.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"seat","l":"Sitz"},{"g":"don't mention it"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"bus"}]},{"text":"Am Ende lag er vorn.","en":"He came out on top.","words":[{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"end, finish"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"he / it"},null]},{"text":"Versuche nach vorn zu schauen!","en":"Try to look ahead.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393451","words":[{"g":"attempt","l":"Versuch"},{"g":"after / to"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to watch, to view"}]}]}